    "extraction_notes": "Image-only PDF (no text layer). Cell geometry recovered from the 200-dpi raster; X marks detected by near-black pixel counts inside rule-bounded cells and confirmed visually against the rendered page. Light grey shading marks cells where no sample is collected and is not transcribed. The abbreviation line below the table ('hr = hour; PK = pharmacokinetic') yielded no annotations: neither term is printed as a marker on a grid cell, header cell or activity label."
